 "notes": [
  "Posted 14 July 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting11': Rescue The Princess, Podrace Prep, Boonta Eve Podrace, Anakin's Podracer, Strike Planning (the free Effect Podrace Prep deploys), Tatooine: Podrace Arena, Prisoner 2187, Death Star: Detention Block Corridor, Death Star: Docking Bay 327, Yavin 4: Docking Bay, Yavin 4: Massassi War Room; these count toward the 60.",
  "Posted 'DS Deten. Block Corridor' dested the Light Death Star: Detention Block Corridor (Special Edition); 'DS Docking Bay' dested the Light Death Star: Docking Bay 327 (Premiere).",
  "Posted 'Coruscant' dested Coruscant (Light) (Special Edition), the only Light Coruscant system printed before the Coruscant set.",
  "Posted 'Tat. Docking Bay' dested Tatooine: Docking Bay 94; 'Tat. City Outskirts' dested Tatooine: City Outskirts.",
  "Posted 'Han w/Blaster Pistol' dested the character Han With Heavy Blaster Pistol (posted under Characters); 'Luke w/Stick' dested Luke With Lightsaber; 'Padme' dested Padme Naberrie; 'Electrobinocs' dested Electrobinoculars; 'Dont Get @#$%y' dested Don't Get Cocky."
